Hi Luiz,

1) You are exactly correct that MSstats multiplies the coefficients by the values in the contrast matrix. What this means when you use fractions is that MSstats will average over those coefficients.

2) Adding in batch to the model has the same impact as what Olga described. MSstats adds additional covariates using the contrast matrix. The impact of averaging over the covariates is the same as adding that variable into the model.

I hope this makes sense!

Devon

